      <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li>A guest track that was importing when Booth quit is imported again on the next launch. Before, it stayed on "Importing and aligning".</li>
<li>If the connection drops when you press Record or Stop, the guest is told as soon as it is back.</li>
<li>If the call page reloads, Booth joins the call again.</li>
</ul>
